diff --git a/apps/cli/tests/LIVE-BUNDLES.md b/apps/cli/tests/LIVE-BUNDLES.md
index 48b9f1eb..8fb120de 100644
--- a/apps/cli/tests/LIVE-BUNDLES.md
+++ b/apps/cli/tests/LIVE-BUNDLES.md
@@ -16,7 +16,11 @@ Not established: code HMR, byte-level integrity of transitive dependencies, acti
 
 `live-bundles-cli.smoke.mjs` runs the locally compiled changed CLI and app-boot, with immutable installed rc2 peers linked into an ancestor of a fresh private profile. It starts the actual web profile on localhost port 0, checks HTTP 200, then calls the same CLI's `plugin --profile web add fixture.tgz --offline --ignore-scripts --store-dir <private-store>`. Real pnpm 11.7.0 installs the zero-dependency local package and the CLI reconciles its manifest while web remains running. The test waits for activation, then runs ten consecutive disable/enable cycles with no inserted sleep. No model API, production profile, or external listener is used.
 
-Server-only small build configuration: `tsconfig.live-cli.json`; compile with the available TypeScript `tsc -p tsconfig.live-cli.json --pretty false`. This is a strict, noEmitOnError build of the reachable CLI/app-boot slice, not a monorepo typecheck. Build artifacts require the CLI package.json and config alongside the compiled files, plus read-only installed rc2 peer node_modules links. The configuration records this test server's type roots explicitly, and is not a general installation recipe.
+Small build configuration: `tsconfig.live-cli.json`; compile with the available TypeScript `tsc -p tsconfig.live-cli.json --pretty false`. This is a strict, noEmitOnError build of the reachable CLI/app-boot slice, not a monorepo typecheck. Supply installed rc2 CLI and app-boot peers through their respective package-local node_modules directories. Prepare `@types/node` and `@types/js-yaml` under `.live-build-deps/node_modules/@types` (copy or link already installed type packages; do not alter global dependencies). No personal absolute type roots are encoded.
+
+After compiling, copy `apps/cli/package.json` into `.live-cli-build/apps/cli/package.json`; link `.live-cli-build/apps/cli/config` to the source CLI config directory, and link the compiled CLI/app-boot node_modules directories to their respective installed peers. These small generated files are not committed. The CLI source has a const-enum dependency, so running it directly with only syntax stripping is not equivalent to this compiled test.
+
+The test child only inherits caller `PATH` and optional `COREPACK_HOME`; explicit `DSH_LIVE_PATH` and `DSH_LIVE_COREPACK_HOME` override those two values. Supply cached pnpm 11.7.0 plus tar on that executable path. Corepack networking is disabled, and HOME/DSH_HOME always point to the new private fixture directory. All other inherited environment variables, including credentials, are excluded. After removing hard-coded paths, the repeated real CLI test passed in `cli-live-E3Ipf6` with ten no-sleep cycles.
 
 Run with `DSH_LIVE_EVIDENCE_PARENT=/srv/pi-lab-dev/tmp/dsh-live-bundle-cli-acceptance node --test apps/cli/tests/live-bundles-cli.smoke.mjs` after building. The immutable successful no-sleep evidence is `cli-live-uLERva` under that parent: web stdout, real pnpm output, final profile manifest, result.json and exit.json. Earlier `cli-live-48sZJF` retains the pre-fix failure: install and disable succeeded but the immediate enable was lost. `cli-live-nLNrfB` and `cli-live-XZPMSJ` used an artificial 200ms interval and are NOT no-sleep regression proof.
 
diff --git a/apps/cli/tests/live-bundles-cli.smoke.mjs b/apps/cli/tests/live-bundles-cli.smoke.mjs
